    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... i look at my partner and my life and i feel so guilty. i feel like i'm just waiting for a way out, but i can't even say that out loud. it feels like the only way to actually get that stillness you're talking about, the only way to really stop the performance, is to just... not exist anymore. does that make sense? like, is it even okay to want that kind of relief?",
